	(text "A0-A7, A9-A12 and D0-D7 are the console's; SRAM A8 = A8 & !A8MASK (glue sheet); A13-A18 are the\nRP's slot lines (GPIO32-37): the 8K page for the slot A13-A15 selects.  /CE is tied active:\n/OE and /WE alone decide when the SRAM answers."
